+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the summed token usage across every provider call in that turn, rather than only the final call's usage ([validated by: sums usage across every provider call when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L65)).
